# Local-first dependencies

For dependency work, prefer `depsonar_*` MCP tools (`scan`, `check`, `changelog`, `audit`, `live_cve`, then `update` at patch/minor) when those tools are available. If a depsonar tool returns nothing within about 60 seconds, fall back to:

```bash
python3 scripts/agent-run.py update-deps
```

Dry-run first. Apply only with `--apply` (patch/minor). Never `git push` from the updater. GitHub Dependabot is weekly backup only.

Gradle/Android: `depsonar_update` on `examples/android` when MCP is on; otherwise Dependabot backup (upd has no Gradle). Kotlin `>=2.3.30` is blocked (CodeQL).

Do not auto-apply inside `verify.sh`. `/ship` runs `/update-deps` then `/prerelease` with `pre-release-gate.sh --local`.
